# IntechOpen

> IntechOpen is a leading global publisher of open-access books and journals
> in science, technology, and medicine (STM). Founded in 2004, IntechOpen
> has published over 6,000 edited volumes and 75,000 peer-reviewed chapters,
> authored by researchers from more than 180 countries. All content is freely
> available under Creative Commons Attribution (CC BY) licenses.

---

## About

IntechOpen publishes peer-reviewed, open-access academic content across all major fields of science, technology, engineering, and medicine. Content is authored by scientists and researchers worldwide and reviewed by independent experts. IntechOpen is a member of the Committee on Publication Ethics (COPE) and CrossRef, and all publications carry a permanent DOI.

IntechOpen operates as an author-funded (article processing charge) open-access model. All published content is permanently freely available to anyone worldwide — no subscription or paywall.

