## Access & Licensing

- All content is **open-access** and freely available to read online and download as PDF.
- Licensed under **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)** unless otherwise stated.
- Full text, abstracts, metadata, and PDFs may be freely accessed without registration.
- Reuse is permitted with proper attribution to the author(s) and IntechOpen.
- Institutional repositories may freely archive IntechOpen content per the CC BY license.

