## Publishing with IntechOpen

Researchers and scientists may submit book proposals or chapter manuscripts:

- [Publish a Book](https://www.intechopen.com/publish-a-book): Propose a new edited volume or book series.
- [Publish a Chapter](https://www.intechopen.com/publish-a-chapter): Contribute a chapter to an existing open call.
- [Publish in a Journal](https://www.intechopen.com/publish-in-journal): Submit an article to an IntechOpen journal.
- [Publishing Benefits](https://www.intechopen.com/publishing-benefits): Open-access advantages for authors and editors.

All submissions are subject to peer review. IntechOpen follows COPE guidelines for research and publication ethics.

