## Structured Data & Metadata

All book, chapter, and journal article pages include machine-readable structured data:

- **Schema.org JSON-LD**: types `Book`, `Chapter`, `ScholarlyArticle`, `Periodical`
- **Google Scholar meta tags**: `citation_title`, `citation_author`, `citation_doi`, `citation_isbn`, `citation_pdf_url`, etc.
- **Dublin Core**: `DC.Title`, `DC.Creator`, `DC.Identifier`, `DC.Date`, `DC.Publisher`
- **Open Graph**: `og:type`, `og:title`, `og:description`, `og:image`

---

## DOI & Citation

- All publications have a permanent DOI resolving via `https://doi.org/10.5772/{id}`
- Preferred citation format: Author(s). "Chapter Title." In: *Book Title*, edited by Editor(s). IntechOpen, Year. DOI: 10.5772/...
- DOI resolver: [https://doi.org](https://doi.org)
- IntechOpen DOI prefix: `10.5772`

