## AI & Crawler Policy

IntechOpen distinguishes between two categories of AI bots:

**Allowed — AI Search Crawlers**: Bots that surface content in AI-powered search results and cite sources with links back to IntechOpen are welcome. This includes OAI-SearchBot (ChatGPT Search), PerplexityBot, Google-Extended, Applebot-Extended, Amazonbot, and YouBot.

**Disallowed — AI Training Scrapers**: Bots that collect content to train AI language models are not permitted. This includes GPTBot, CCBot, ClaudeBot, Bytespider, Diffbot, FacebookBot, Meta-ExternalAgent, and others. See robots.txt for the full list.

Full policy: [https://www.intechopen.com/robots.txt](https://www.intechopen.com/robots.txt)

Note: IntechOpen content is licensed under CC BY 4.0, which permits reuse with attribution. However, use by AI training crawlers may conflict with author rights and publisher terms. Researchers seeking to use IntechOpen content for research purposes should contact permissions@intechopen.com.

